    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "This exceptional residence combines space, style, and tranquillity, set within beautifully landscaped grounds and presented in immaculate condition. Designed for modern living, it offers bright, flowing accommodation that captures natural light and frames the surrounding countryside at every turn. Inside, two inviting reception rooms provide warm, versatile spaces for family life or entertaining. The large kitchen/dining area forms the heart of the home — a contemporary, beautifully \u001dfinished space ideal for cooking, gathering, and everyday living. A generous open-plan TV/lounge/offce area adds further flexibility, perfect for work, relaxation, or additional family space, all while enjoying wonderful views. The bedroom accommodation is spacious and refi\u001dned, with four double bedrooms downstairs, two featuring private en suites. Each room is tastefully decorated with high-quality fi\u001dnishes, and many enjoy far-reaching views towards Tacumshane Lakes and all the way to the Irish Sea. Set on approximately 0.59 acres, the grounds are thoughtfully landscaped with mature planting, manicured lawns, and multiple patio areas offering ideal spaces for outdoor dining, entertaining, or simply enjoying the peaceful surroundings. Ample parking further enhances convenience. The location is superb —close to Killinick, Tacumshane, and Our Lady’s Island villages, with easy access to local amenities. Wexford Town is just 14km away, while Rosslare Harbour (9km) provides excellent transport links. A selection of stunning sandy beaches, including Carne, St. Margaret’s, Rosslare Strand, and Ballytrent, are all within easy reach. Combining contemporary comfort with rural serenity, this beautifully fi\u001dnished home represents a rare opportunity to acquire a truly desirable property in a highly sought-after location.\r\n\r\nVIEWING HIGHLY RECOMMENDED"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Property Accommodation\r\nPorch – (1.7m x 1.6m),\r\nHall – (3.7m x 2.8m), & (11.5m x 1.2m) ,Vinyl tile and tiled floor, hot press off, stairs off.\r\nLiving Room – (5.8m x 4.5m), Bay window, stove.\r\nKitchen/ Diner –  (5.9m x 4.8m), Waist level units, kitchen island, dresser, plumbed for dishwasher, Rayburn oil \u001dred range, tiled floor and splashback, opening to\r\nDining Room – (3.6m x 3.6m), Tiled floor.\r\nUtility Room – (3.5m x 2.4m), Waist level units, plumbed for washing machine, tiled floor and splash back, door to outside.\r\nGuest WC – (1.8m x 1.5m), WC, WHB, tiled floor.\r\nBedroom No. 1 – (3.6m x 3.5m), Wood floor.\r\nBathroom – (3.5m x 2.3m), WC, WHB, Slipper bath, shower, tiled floor.\r\nBedroom No. 2 – (4.0m x 3.5m), Wood floor.\r\nBedroom No. 3 – (3.6m x 3.4m), Wood floor.\r\nMaster Bedroom – (5.0m x 3.6m), Wood floor, treble wardrobe, double aspect, door to\r\nEn-suite – (2.7m x 1.2m), WC, WHB, Shower, tiled floor.\r\n\r\nUpstairs\r\nLiving area – (7.0m x 4.9m), Wood floor.\r\nStore room – (3.7m x 2.2m), Wood floor, storage off.\r\nBedroom No. 5 – (4.9m x 4.9m), Wood floor.\r\nShower Room  – (4.9m x 2.1m), WC, WHB, shower, wood floor.\r\n\r\nOutside: Driveway with electric gates, gardens to front, parking, patio area, outbuildings.\r\nServices: Electricity, mains water, private sewerage, Oil \u001dfired central heating.\r\nBER: C3 Ber No: 112536206 Performance indicator: 224.20 kWh/m2/yr\r\nApply: Keane Auctioneers (053) 9123072"
